## 1. Goal and scope

Hero Housing Finance (HHFL) is an NBFC (home loans, LAP). The **Customer Interaction
Intelligence (CII)** portal is used by company officials (collections, customer care,
management) on **laptops** to monitor customer calls, collections calls and emails and
their AI analysis. English only.

The current UI looks unprofessional (pastel gradients, giant hero banners, centered
text everywhere, tiny low-contrast labels, raw UUIDs, fake `0/100` gauges, overlapping
cards, 4-5 table rows visible per screen). We are doing a **complete visual redesign**
so it feels professional, modern, calm and trustworthy, like enterprise banking software.

**This is a UI-ONLY change.** Features, flows, routes, data, labels and the backend are
finalised and must not change.

