| `--cii-primary-hover` | `#143D7A` | hover |
| `--cii-primary-tint` | `#EEF3FB` | selected row, active list item, info panels |
| `--cii-brand-red` | `#E2231A` | ONLY the small logo mark. Never for errors. |
| `--cii-bg` | `#F6F8FB` | page background |
| `--cii-surface` | `#FFFFFF` | cards, tables, drawers |
| `--cii-border` | `#E4E8EF` | all borders and dividers |
| `--cii-text` | `#101828` | primary text |
| `--cii-text-2` | `#475467` | secondary text |
| `--cii-text-3` | `#667085` | labels, captions |
| success | `#067647` on `#ECFDF3` | positive, kept, resolved, pass |
| warning | `#B54708` on `#FFFAEB` | medium, due, attention |
| danger | `#B42318` on `#FEF3F2` | high risk, broken, complaint, fail |
| info | `#175CD3` on `#EFF8FF` | informational |
| neutral | `#475467` on `#F2F4F7` | default chips |
| channel: Customer Care | `#175CD3` | channel badges and timeline dots |
| channel: Collections | `#6941C6` | |
