## 5. Cross-page rules
- The same entity looks the same everywhere: a customer name is 13-14px/600 in primary
  color; money uses `inr()`; dates use `dateTime()/dateOnly()`; sentiment, priority,
  channel and status use the shared pills/badges only.
- Buttons: ONE style set (primary = navy filled, secondary = white with border,
  ghost = text). Height 36px, radius 8px, 13px/500. Remove all one-off red/blue/green
  buttons.
- Remove duplicated per-page icon sets in the CII files; use `lucide-react`.
- No inline `style={{}}` for static styling; use classes/tokens. Dynamic values (ring
  percentages, bar widths) may use inline style.
- Responsive: ≥1280 full layout, 1024-1279 rails collapse under content, <1024 single
  column, tables scroll horizontally in their container.

